C00,J519 - Central Electric
C01,     +1 DRLs always ON, not optional in MFI
C02,     +2 Driving Light for USA/Canada (Xenon Low Beams Off when High Beams are On)
C03,     +4 Interior Comfort Lighting Enabled
C04,     +8 Rain & Light Sensors Enabled
C05,    +16 Coming Home Lights Enabled
C06,    +32 Rear Fog Lamps Enabled
C07,    +64 Front Fog Lamps Enabled
C08,   +128 Xenon Lighting Installed/Enabled
C09,   +256 Marker Lights for USA/Canada Enabled
C10,   +512 [Function Unknown]
C11,  +1024 Headlight Washers Enabled
C12,  +2048 Electric Fuel Pump Relay Block (Gasoline Engines Only!)
C13,  +4096 Wake-up function Enabled (for Air Suspension)
C14,  +8192 Second Battery Enabled
C15  +16384 Auxilliary  Battery Enabled (V10 TDI only)
C16, +32768 Low-line Seat Heating Enabled (No Memory Seats Only)
C17, +65536 Electric Load Management Enabled
C18,+131072 Rear Fog Disabled when Off-Roads Suspension Set (Japan Only)
C19, 
C20,Coding is the sum of the individual options
